# The learning site's pages moved under /academy/, and their old addresses lead to them for good,
# with the query and fragment they came with: a lab's download prints a link to its page, whose
# fragment carries the stages done on the learner's machine.
/review /academy/review/ 301
/review/ /academy/review/ 301
/ai-engineering /academy/ai-engineering/ 301
/ai-engineering/* /academy/ai-engineering/:splat 301

# The site's own address opens the Academy until it has a home page of its own.
/ /academy/ 302

# The app draws its pages in the browser (decision record 47). Its files are served as they are,
# and every other address under /app/ answers with its page.
/app/assets/* /app/assets/:splat 200
/app/* /app/ 200
